2️⃣ Microservices Basics (Interview Explanation)
❓ What is Microservice Architecture?

Each business capability runs as an independent service.

Services have:

Own database

Own deployment

Own scaling

Communication happens via HTTP/REST.

❓ Why Microservices?

Independent scaling

Fault isolation

Independent deployment

Technology flexibility

Better team ownership

