.block() makes it synchronous.

Microservice → Microservice REST communication.

JSON mapping to DTO.

In production we should avoid .block() in reactive systems.

8️⃣ Transaction Management

@Transactional

What it does:

Opens DB transaction.

Commits if success.

Rolls back if exception.

Important:

Used readOnly=true for optimization.

Interview Answer:

Transaction ensures atomicity and consistency of database operations.

